# Cloudflare Pages headers for the app's web build; `flutter build web` copies
# this file in. Every file is cross-origin isolated, not just the page: Drift's
# OPFS storage needs it, and it starts its worker from drift_worker.js (local
# runs get the same two from web_dev_config.yaml). The app is noindex on every
# host, dev and prod — docs/decisions/static-web-hosting.md.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
